What this licence covers, and what it does not

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository written for it: the
workspace packages under packages/, the grid-paper theme under
apps/deck/themes/, and the configuration and tooling at the repository root.

It does not cover the following, which stay under the terms stated here:

1. The talk. The content of apps/deck/slides/ (slide text, speaker notes,
   structure and images) and the documents under docs/ are
   Copyright (c) 2026 Jonas Broms, all rights reserved. Reading and running
   them is welcome; republishing or presenting them as your own is not
   permitted without written permission. Code patterns in those files may be
   reused under the MIT licence above.

2. React Bits components. packages/grid-paper/src/DotGrid.tsx, DotGrid.css,
   CursorGrid.tsx, CursorGrid.css and Crosshair.tsx are from React Bits by
   David Haz and remain under their own licence (MIT with the Commons Clause),
   reproduced in packages/grid-paper/LICENSE-react-bits.md.

3. Inter. apps/deck/assets/fonts/InterVariable.woff2 is by The Inter Project
   Authors and remains under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, reproduced in
   apps/deck/assets/fonts/LICENSE.txt.

4. Installed agent skills under apps/deck/.agents/ belong to their authors
   and keep their own terms.
